      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'An incentive program that awards the employee for their performance
        with <b>GeneBucks</b>; a currency that can be used to purchase various tools
        & trinkets from <b>Gene''s Corporate Emporium</b> (see last page).



        <b><u>Reward
        Values</b></u>

        - Correct Parameter - <b>(+20 per Parameter)</b>

        -
        Meet Daily Quota - <b>(+50)</b>

        - Chaos Defecit - <b>(-5 per chaos
        point under balance)</b>

        - Chaos Surplus - <b>(+5 per chaos point
        over balance)</b>

        - Flawless - <b>(x2 total score)</b>



        Final
        score is converted to GeneBucks and awarded at end of day <b>(10 score points
        per GeneBuck)</b>'
