    - target: {fileID: 6827236520903665188, guid: c00d21ee0b9eeb443a0c4c56255d92a2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Every decision made while granting a caller''s wish comes with a cost
        to the natual order (otherwise referred to as <b>Chaos Index</b>). Each wish
        comes with an inherent <b>Chaos Cost</b> as decided by its <b>Parameters</b>.


        Your
        job is not only to figure out what parameters fit each wish but also decide
        what <b>Consequences</b> should befall each caller in order to balance the
        cost of their wish.


        According to the laws of natural order the
        index ranges from <b>-3</b> to <b>+3</b> and should always remain at <b>0</b>
        to maintain consistent and predictable acts of fate.


        For this reason,
        they advise you keep each wish as balanced as possible in order to avoid
        tipping the scales too far.


        Submitting a <b>WishRequest</b> with
        a <i>defecit</i> of <b>Chaos Cost</b> will result in a strike for incorrect
        balancing. Otherwise, submitting with a <i>surplus</i> will warrant a bonus
        paid in <b>GeneBucks</b>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
