    - target: {fileID: 6827236520903665188, guid: c00d21ee0b9eeb443a0c4c56255d92a2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'At the start of a shift, the callers for that day will populate the
        phone queue.



        The Yellow lights on the top of the unit indicate
        a caller waiting on hold.


        Picking up the phone will answer the
        call in the next queue position.


        Clicking the phone while in a
        call will hang up.


        Caution: Once a caller disconnects they can
        never be reached again!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
