    - target: {fileID: 6827236520903665188, guid: c00d21ee0b9eeb443a0c4c56255d92a2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Forms are comprised of four sections:



        <b><u>Caller Info</b></u>

        Basic
        details to identify caller (generated by the system when caller enters the
        queue).

        <b><u>Parameters</b></u>

        What does the caller''s
        wish entail?

        <b><u>Consequences</b></u>

        How should the
        scales of fate be levelled?

        <b><u>Stamp Field</b></u>

        Approve
        or Deny wish.




        Each Form can be drawn on (via the <b>Pencil</b>),
        any marking inside a checkbox will register that item as selected.



        Using
        the <b>Eraser</b> on any part of a checkbox will automatically clear the
        entire box.



        The <b>Approve</b> & <b>Deny</b> Stamps can be used
        to finalise a form via the <b>Stamp Field</b>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
